OL,3,GNEWSAHow can more girls be encouraged  
OL,4,Ato take up sport?                      
OL,6,FWork is being done to encourage girls  
OL,7,Fto stay active as they move into       
OL,8,Fsecondary school, after a survey found 
OL,9,Ffewer playing sport after leaving      
OL,10,Fprimary school.                        
OL,12,FThe 2026 Active Healthy Kids Report    
OL,13,FCard led by the Health Improvement     
OL,14,FCommission found 60% of girls in       
OL,15,Fprimary met global recommendations on  
OL,16,Fphysical activity, which dropped to 51%
OL,17,Fin secondary.                          
