OL,3,GNEWSAHow can more girls be encouraged  
OL,4,Ato take up sport?                      
OL,6,FFor boys it went up from 66% to 68%.   
OL,7,FThe World Health Organization's        
OL,8,Frecommendation for children and        
OL,9,Fadolescents is at least 60 min of      
OL,10,Fmoderate to vigorous physical activity 
OL,11,F- such as running, cycling or swimming 
OL,12,F- per day on average.                  
OL,14,FJane, 15, and Bella, 16, are members of
OL,15,FThe Youth Commission's Youth Forum and 
OL,16,Fthink there are a variety of reasons   
OL,17,Fwhy girls may not continue sports -    
OL,18,Fincluding exam pressures and social    
OL,19,Fmedia.                                 
